WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 30]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:56.350 --> 01:58.020
Now, let the tale begin.

01:59.280 --> 02:01.620
Old secrets lie buried in dusty pages,

02:02.150 --> 02:04.830
and every healer has their secret remedy.

02:05.270 --> 02:06.400
Ladies and gentlemen,

02:06.670 --> 02:08.340
do you truly think

02:09.440 --> 02:12.020
Master Zhang had run out of options?

02:12.320 --> 02:13.300
Do you truly think

02:13.440 --> 02:16.090
the heroes of the Mystic Nine had vanished?

02:16.830 --> 02:17.690
Not so.

02:18.320 --> 02:19.090
Not so.

02:19.710 --> 02:21.140
From the moment Master Zhang

02:21.440 --> 02:22.460
entered the city,

02:22.550 --> 02:24.140
he already knew

02:24.550 --> 02:25.180
that this time,

02:25.320 --> 02:27.690
the Mystic Nine were headed for a terrible ordeal.

02:28.510 --> 02:30.300
So before entering the city,

02:30.480 --> 02:31.970
he made up his mind

02:32.200 --> 02:33.900
to devise a plan,

02:34.390 --> 02:36.620
a flawless,

02:36.950 --> 02:39.300
airtight scheme

02:39.880 --> 02:42.370
that would ultimately lead to one outcome:

02:42.760 --> 02:43.460
the end

02:44.040 --> 02:47.210
of the Mystic Nine.

02:48.080 --> 02:48.810
And so,

02:49.360 --> 02:51.420
on the day Wu Laogou was to be executed,

02:51.990 --> 02:53.460
people suddenly found

02:53.600 --> 02:55.090
that all of Changsha

02:55.200 --> 02:57.740
was bathed

02:59.270 --> 03:01.340
in brilliant starlight.

03:06.640 --> 03:07.480
To make the Ministry of War

03:07.480 --> 03:08.740
believe the Mystic Nine had been purged,

03:09.300 --> 03:10.370
Luo Ang was the key.

03:11.150 --> 03:12.380
Scheming and cunning,

03:12.840 --> 03:13.940
he knew how deeply I cared

03:13.960 --> 03:14.690
for the Mystic Nine

03:15.000 --> 03:16.220
and how hard it'd be for me to act against them.

03:17.190 --> 03:17.940
So Luo Ang

03:18.430 --> 03:20.010
must have prepared for both possibilities.

03:20.960 --> 03:21.540
On one hand,

03:22.080 --> 03:23.060
he'd try his best to persuade me.

03:24.000 --> 03:24.540
On the other,

03:25.160 --> 03:27.380
he'd make sure the Mystic Nine would be wiped out.

03:28.760 --> 03:30.010
Xie Jiu made himself part of the scheme...

03:30.030 --> 03:30.380
Master Zhang.

03:30.480 --> 03:31.340
And made Luo believe

03:31.560 --> 03:32.650
I'd been driven into a corner

03:32.650 --> 03:33.350
[Wu Laogou]

03:33.350 --> 03:34.300
[Executed]
and had no choice but to turn

03:34.320 --> 03:35.780
[by Master Zhang in Person]
on the Mystic Nine to save myself.

03:37.350 --> 03:38.410
No one could've imagined

03:39.670 --> 03:40.780
we still had one final move,

03:41.830 --> 03:42.810
one that could turn the tide

03:43.670 --> 03:44.780
at the very last moment.

03:44.780 --> 03:47.660
[Favorable Weather]

03:51.020 --> 04:04.340
[United Hearts Society]

04:13.190 --> 04:13.700
Master Zhang.

04:15.120 --> 04:15.740
Is everyone here?

04:16.230 --> 04:16.760
Yes.

04:17.190 --> 04:18.140
They're waiting for you inside.

04:26.820 --> 04:30.460
[The Mystic Nine United]

04:35.280 --> 04:36.340
Master Zhang,

04:37.800 --> 04:39.140
you're late.

04:40.160 --> 04:41.700
Even Laogou got here before you.

04:42.000 --> 04:43.340
Exactly, Master Zhang.

04:44.110 --> 04:45.060
You're buying

04:45.470 --> 04:46.420
the drinks today.

04:47.280 --> 04:48.340
Hurry and send Xiaoyu and Xiaojin

04:48.360 --> 04:49.180
to get some wine.

04:49.470 --> 04:50.420
What?

04:51.160 --> 04:52.700
Those two are still officially dead.

04:53.200 --> 04:54.540
If they go outside and anyone sees them,

04:54.800 --> 04:55.900
people will think they've seen ghosts.

04:58.080 --> 04:58.850
Dog brain.

04:59.470 --> 05:00.140
Bad memory.

05:02.750 --> 05:04.540
It's been confirmed that Luo Ang has left Changsha.

05:05.200 --> 05:05.900
I was just

05:07.560 --> 05:08.340
waiting for this.

05:14.540 --> 05:15.560
[Wu Laogou Executed]

05:15.560 --> 05:17.260
Xiangu's reporter did a good job

05:18.440 --> 05:19.900
and made me look quite handsome.

05:20.080 --> 05:20.980
But you look rather...

05:28.030 --> 05:29.540
Thanks to Master Zhang's brilliant plan,

05:29.920 --> 05:31.450
everything worked out perfectly.

05:32.440 --> 05:33.940
Luo Ang personally supervised

05:35.190 --> 05:37.220
the purge of the Mystic Nine,

05:38.350 --> 05:39.330
and he also signed

05:39.350 --> 05:40.290
the final report himself.

05:40.960 --> 05:42.450
If anyone grows suspicious in the future,

05:43.000 --> 05:44.010
since he handled the case,

05:44.310 --> 05:46.140
he'll have no choice but to suppress it for us

05:47.160 --> 05:48.420
to protect his own career.

05:48.910 --> 05:49.500
Wonderful.

05:49.950 --> 05:50.540
This time,

05:51.360 --> 05:52.930
we're finally safe for good.

05:55.680 --> 05:57.020
Now that the Mystic Nine

05:57.510 --> 05:58.540
no longer exists publicly,

05:58.750 --> 06:01.020
where will each of us go from here?

06:14.190 --> 06:15.050
I'm going to Beiping.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.250
Perhaps a new age

06:17.830 --> 06:18.730
really is coming.

06:19.720 --> 06:20.810
I want to see for myself

06:21.630 --> 06:22.730
whether this new world

06:23.040 --> 06:24.020
has a place for women

06:24.070 --> 06:24.930
to stand on their own.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.340
If it does,

06:27.310 --> 06:28.540
I'll be the first.

06:32.120 --> 06:32.780
I'm not leaving.

06:34.750 --> 06:35.700
The people and things

06:36.680 --> 06:37.540
I care about

06:38.390 --> 06:39.140
are all here.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.020
Neither am I.

06:45.480 --> 06:46.020
I'm tired.

06:47.630 --> 06:48.850
Changsha...

06:49.190 --> 06:50.900
I've fought for it and defended it.

06:51.680 --> 06:52.700
I'm staying here.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.810
The world is vast.

06:55.390 --> 06:56.410
I can go anywhere.

06:56.950 --> 06:58.490
If Changsha is no longer a place for me,

06:59.790 --> 07:01.460
perhaps I'll find somewhere better.

07:06.390 --> 07:07.020
Second Master,

07:09.190 --> 07:10.050
have you made any plans?

07:14.160 --> 07:15.460
I've decided to return

07:16.720 --> 07:17.410
to Guizhou tonight.

07:18.120 --> 07:19.370
It's beautiful there.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.410
I've taken in a few disciples.

07:21.920 --> 07:22.780
I'll teach them opera.

07:23.310 --> 07:24.250
We'll farm, study, and carry on our traditions.

07:24.950 --> 07:25.700
It'll be a peaceful life.

07:26.430 --> 07:26.900
Good.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.140
And you?

07:32.800 --> 07:33.220
Master Zhang,

07:33.950 --> 07:34.660
I've decided

07:35.000 --> 07:36.610
where I'm going.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.610
So have I.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.810
I'll move to Hangzhou.

07:45.000 --> 07:46.020
Xie Jiu wrote

07:46.390 --> 07:47.340
that it's a beautiful place.

07:48.560 --> 07:50.610
I'll read books

07:50.750 --> 07:51.850
and compose poetry there.

07:52.560 --> 07:52.930
It'll be nice.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.580
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.900
These two jars were sealed when the Mystic Nine was founded.

08:09.070 --> 08:09.850
Should we

08:11.560 --> 08:12.490
open them today?

08:26.270 --> 08:27.410
To Ninth Master.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.540
To Ninth Master.

08:40.180 --> 08:43.540
♪A handful of homeland soil carries the scent of dust...♪

08:44.200 --> 08:46.420
Until we meet again.

08:47.080 --> 08:48.300
Until we meet again.

08:50.260 --> 08:53.420
♪A single bright lamp preserves your image♪

08:54.700 --> 08:58.580
♪My life belongs to distant lands, with no room to dwell on love♪

09:00.300 --> 09:03.540
♪Holding a pool of autumn water, we share the same robe♪

09:05.220 --> 09:08.660
♪You sit in your lone city while I protect my hometown♪

09:10.180 --> 09:14.540
♪I dip my brush into the western wind to paint the setting sun♪

09:14.860 --> 09:19.220
♪The returning ravens are too noisy, how can I fight back?♪

09:20.140 --> 09:24.500
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back♪

09:24.820 --> 09:29.660
♪Every moment with you appears in my heart♪

09:30.020 --> 09:34.620
♪My burning heart turns ashen, my hair turns white♪

09:35.060 --> 09:39.820
♪I look at you whilst I yearn for you♪

09:40.100 --> 09:44.420
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

09:44.740 --> 09:49.500
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

09:49.940 --> 09:54.540
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

09:54.900 --> 10:00.940
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

10:13.480 --> 10:14.370
Did he say anything

10:15.870 --> 10:16.820
before he died?

10:18.550 --> 10:20.100
Ninth Master said he was honored to do it all

10:21.550 --> 10:22.730
as the last of the Mystic Nine.

10:23.030 --> 10:24.530
The foundation of the Mystic Nine

10:24.630 --> 10:25.850
lies with its top leader.

10:26.030 --> 10:27.460
He must be righteous and strong

10:27.630 --> 10:28.700
and never take the wrong path.

10:28.870 --> 10:29.940
As for the difficult things

10:30.000 --> 10:31.250
that still must be done,

10:31.390 --> 10:33.180
the Xie Clan will take them on.

10:33.670 --> 10:34.980
I will bear the consequences myself.

10:35.120 --> 10:36.370
As long as I can protect the Mystic Nine

10:36.480 --> 10:37.370
and serve the people,

10:37.550 --> 10:38.420
it will be worth it.

10:40.080 --> 10:40.650
Jiu,

10:44.120 --> 10:45.300
you did so much

10:47.790 --> 10:48.940
and helped so many people.

10:52.360 --> 10:53.720
Yet in the end, people on the streets

10:53.720 --> 10:54.890
call you a traitor

10:57.670 --> 10:58.770
and a lackey.

11:02.750 --> 11:03.420
Was it worth it?

11:05.060 --> 11:09.380
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

11:09.700 --> 11:14.460
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

11:14.900 --> 11:19.460
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty...♪

11:19.460 --> 11:21.020
[Master Zhang Leads the Mystic Nine in Securing Southern Changsha]

11:21.020 --> 11:25.020
[Romance of the Three Kingdoms]

11:29.080 --> 11:29.700
So the Mystic Nine

11:30.480 --> 11:31.580
are really gone?

11:35.150 --> 11:36.250
What do you think?

11:37.270 --> 11:37.940
Child,

11:38.480 --> 11:40.370
the heroes of the Sui and Tang dynasties

11:40.510 --> 11:41.300
were mighty, weren't they?

11:42.150 --> 11:42.890
They're gone.

11:43.480 --> 11:45.850
The Wei, Shu, and Wu Kingdoms once divided the realm.

11:46.320 --> 11:47.770
Are they still standing today?

11:48.550 --> 11:50.600
Even Zhang Fei and Guan Yunchang

11:50.600 --> 11:51.650
are long gone.

11:53.390 --> 11:53.940
Here.

11:53.940 --> 11:55.200
[Romance of the Three Kingdoms]

11:55.200 --> 11:56.370
Look at this book.

11:56.870 --> 11:58.580
All the heroes in here

11:59.200 --> 12:01.770
are gone the moment you

12:03.000 --> 12:03.940
turn the page.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.850
That's why the old saying goes,

12:07.270 --> 12:10.010
"Every hero must one day leave the stage."

12:10.510 --> 12:11.770
But there's another old saying:

12:12.360 --> 12:14.460
"Every age brings forth its own heroes,

12:14.600 --> 12:17.100
each leaving their mark for centuries."

12:18.480 --> 12:19.650
I once read in the newspaper

12:20.200 --> 12:22.770
that as long as the spirit of the people endures,

12:23.240 --> 12:25.610
the bright future of China

12:25.870 --> 12:27.530
will one day rest

12:27.630 --> 12:31.300
in the hands of every Chinese citizen.

12:32.720 --> 12:33.250
Bravo!

12:33.630 --> 12:35.890
Though the Mystic Nine went their separate ways,

12:35.960 --> 12:37.250
each following a different path,

12:37.590 --> 12:40.980
after their story ended, the world changed drastically

12:41.150 --> 12:45.220
and underwent a cataclysmic upheaval.

12:46.550 --> 12:47.820
"Today, the responsibility

12:48.510 --> 12:49.250
lies not with others,

12:49.250 --> 12:50.440
[Guizhou]

12:50.440 --> 12:51.890
but entirely with us, the young.

12:54.360 --> 12:56.820
If the youth are wise, the nation will be wise."

12:57.080 --> 12:58.880
[Young China]

12:58.900 --> 13:00.700
"If the youth are wise, the nation will be wise."

13:01.120 --> 13:04.300
"If the youth are strong, the nation will be strong."

13:04.720 --> 13:07.650
"If the youth are strong, the nation will be strong."

13:07.790 --> 13:08.530
Mr. Hong.

13:16.910 --> 13:17.490
Sir.

13:19.240 --> 13:20.730
Thank you for taking care

13:21.670 --> 13:22.700
of our fallen soldiers' children.

13:23.630 --> 13:24.530
We will never forget

13:25.320 --> 13:26.650
your kindness.

13:27.670 --> 13:28.490
The 20 dan of grain

13:28.910 --> 13:30.820
and five cases of sulfa drugs

13:30.960 --> 13:31.980
you sent recently,

13:32.390 --> 13:34.420
along with 30 Hanyang rifles,

13:34.750 --> 13:36.010
have all arrived safely.

13:36.550 --> 13:37.890
They came just when we needed them most

13:38.390 --> 13:40.010
and solved an urgent problem for us.

13:41.150 --> 13:42.010
It's just...

13:42.630 --> 13:43.130
Sir,

13:44.840 --> 13:45.340
come with me.

13:52.870 --> 13:53.490
A radio?

13:56.360 --> 13:57.340
How did you get this?

13:59.360 --> 14:00.010
Wonderful!

14:00.320 --> 14:01.420
It really wasn't easy to obtain.

14:02.480 --> 14:04.220
I had to pull a lot of strings

14:05.000 --> 14:05.650
to get it here

14:06.320 --> 14:06.980
last night.

14:07.510 --> 14:08.820
This is wonderful.

14:09.440 --> 14:10.820
These days, we've had no way

14:11.270 --> 14:12.250
to contact our superiors

14:12.270 --> 14:13.530
without a radio.

14:13.910 --> 14:14.700
You've really done us

14:14.720 --> 14:15.650
a tremendous favor.

14:15.960 --> 14:16.490
Mr. Hong,

14:16.910 --> 14:18.250
you're a miracle worker.

14:18.600 --> 14:19.530
Thank you.

14:20.120 --> 14:21.010
Thank you so much.

14:21.360 --> 14:21.980
Thank you.

14:22.440 --> 14:23.060
Thank you.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.010
Yatou,

14:59.510 --> 15:00.530
I've made you suffer again.

15:01.720 --> 15:02.490
Just wait a bit longer.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.700
Soon, we'll see

15:06.670 --> 15:07.650
a world at peace.

15:11.150 --> 15:11.650
Look.

15:13.910 --> 15:14.700
I've prepared

15:14.720 --> 15:15.890
a coffin for myself.

15:16.870 --> 15:18.220
I even had it made a little taller.

15:24.390 --> 15:25.370
When my time finally comes,

15:29.720 --> 15:31.370
we'll be together just as before.

15:32.910 --> 15:34.850
You'll rest quietly against my shoulder

15:40.910 --> 15:42.180
and listen to me sing.

16:03.440 --> 16:03.980
Be careful.

16:04.150 --> 16:04.530
All right.

16:08.910 --> 16:09.490
Hold it tight.

16:10.150 --> 16:10.890
Tie it securely.

16:12.390 --> 16:13.420
Don't leave it loose.

16:19.840 --> 16:20.250
Third Master,

16:20.790 --> 16:21.700
everything's loaded.

16:21.910 --> 16:22.490
We're ready to go.

16:24.080 --> 16:24.730
Coming.

16:33.550 --> 16:33.980
Go.

16:35.320 --> 16:36.010
The earlier you leave,

16:37.030 --> 16:38.730
the fewer people you'll meet on the way.

16:46.150 --> 16:48.940
One, two, three, four.

16:58.910 --> 17:00.060
I know what you're going to do.

17:04.880 --> 17:06.050
Go and do what you have to.

17:07.790 --> 17:08.700
Don't worry about us.

17:36.920 --> 17:37.700
Don't worry.

17:41.030 --> 17:42.700
I'll take good care of our son

17:45.590 --> 17:47.180
and keep him safe as he grows up.

17:57.200 --> 17:57.770
Good.

18:23.680 --> 18:24.220
We're off.

18:28.000 --> 18:28.980
Come on, Yan.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.050
Son.

18:38.110 --> 18:39.140
Goodbye, Father.

18:44.480 --> 18:45.220
Goodbye, son.

19:02.590 --> 19:03.730
Goodbye, Father.

19:31.180 --> 19:32.900
[Prosperity for Five Generations]

19:41.400 --> 19:42.460
Ms. Bai left too?

19:46.480 --> 19:47.560
You know

19:47.560 --> 19:48.600
what she's like.

19:48.680 --> 19:49.500
Stubborn as ever.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.180
She refused to leave.

19:51.790 --> 19:54.090
But then she went

19:55.160 --> 19:56.290
and got pregnant with my child.

19:57.720 --> 19:58.620
Even I, Heibei Laoliu,

19:59.310 --> 20:00.380
am going to be a father.

20:06.350 --> 20:08.050
What's it like being a father?

20:10.750 --> 20:11.140
Never mind.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.730
With your situation,

20:15.160 --> 20:15.980
you wouldn't know.

20:16.070 --> 20:17.090
Why wouldn't I know?

20:18.270 --> 20:19.010
My son

20:19.030 --> 20:20.460
calls me Father now.

20:21.160 --> 20:22.490
Your son calls you Father now?

20:22.720 --> 20:23.860
Of course.

20:24.790 --> 20:25.940
Your sister-in-law agreed to it?

20:29.030 --> 20:30.180
Call her Third Sister-in-law from now on.

20:35.830 --> 20:37.030
Now that's worth celebrating.

20:37.030 --> 20:37.980
- Come on. - We're both fathers.

20:38.160 --> 20:38.980
- Come on. - Let's have a drink.

20:39.070 --> 20:39.570
Cheers.

20:44.590 --> 20:46.510
In the old days, whenever goods

20:46.510 --> 20:47.570
entered Changsha,

20:48.680 --> 20:50.050
they had to pass through the Mystic Nine.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.140
Now that the Japanese are here,

20:54.350 --> 20:55.770
that rule can't change.

20:58.750 --> 20:59.380
Exactly.

21:02.590 --> 21:03.900
Someone has to stay behind

21:05.160 --> 21:06.380
and keep the road ahead

21:07.960 --> 21:08.900
guarded.

21:12.550 --> 21:12.980
Come on.

21:13.790 --> 21:14.220
Cheers.

21:17.270 --> 21:18.090
This is bad!

21:18.310 --> 21:19.460
The Japanese have broken into the city!

21:20.000 --> 21:20.570
Run!

21:21.270 --> 21:22.290
The Japanese are here!

21:24.350 --> 21:24.940
Run!

21:25.000 --> 21:25.980
The Japanese are here!

21:53.720 --> 21:55.530
How many men do you still have?

21:56.440 --> 21:57.250
None of them left.

23:04.790 --> 23:06.420
The sky sure is red today.

23:07.960 --> 23:09.620
Perfect for a good fight.

23:10.830 --> 23:11.860
One last battle

23:12.680 --> 23:14.010
for Changsha.

24:08.300 --> 24:09.580
[Xiangchun Gate]

24:15.660 --> 24:20.140
[Xiangchun Gate]

24:21.500 --> 24:24.550
[Guangxi]

24:24.550 --> 24:25.530
Get him!

24:27.400 --> 24:28.660
He must be nearby.

24:29.400 --> 24:30.330
He's killed so many of our men.

24:30.720 --> 24:33.220
I'll kill him myself!

24:33.350 --> 24:34.380
Find him!

25:53.590 --> 25:55.050
It's... It's you.

26:05.400 --> 26:05.980
Look at this.

26:06.920 --> 26:08.700
A new dog-training facility opened in Hangzhou.

26:09.070 --> 26:09.860
They say the dogs there

26:10.030 --> 26:11.810
can sniff out buried land mines,

26:12.240 --> 26:13.530
patrol, carry messages,

26:13.640 --> 26:14.490
catch thieves,

26:14.590 --> 26:15.290
and find food.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.660
[Master Dog Trainer]
Far better than the foreign police

26:17.750 --> 26:18.620
[Hidden in Hangzhou Dog-Training Kennel]
in the concession.

26:18.620 --> 26:19.660
[Hunan Master Works Wonders with Dogs]

26:20.070 --> 26:21.250
Sounds like boasting to me.

26:21.440 --> 26:22.770
No matter how clever a dog is,

26:22.830 --> 26:24.140
it can't work miracles, can it?

26:25.270 --> 26:26.140
You'd be surprised.

26:26.270 --> 26:27.250
The paper says

26:27.480 --> 26:29.190
there's a master dog trainer there.

26:29.400 --> 26:30.660
Apparently, he's incredibly skilled,

26:31.030 --> 26:32.860
but he never shows his face.

26:33.400 --> 26:34.490
They say he isn't a local.

26:35.030 --> 26:37.140
He came from Changsha

26:37.880 --> 26:39.810
and married into a family in Hangzhou,

26:39.830 --> 26:40.940
then settled down there.

26:44.640 --> 26:45.420
Who are you?

26:46.960 --> 26:47.530
Hey, miss,

26:47.640 --> 26:48.620
what's the matter with you?

26:49.510 --> 26:50.290
Forget it.

26:50.830 --> 26:51.460
That's enough money

26:51.480 --> 26:52.380
to buy ten newspapers.

26:52.640 --> 26:53.180
Let's eat.

27:07.460 --> 27:11.750
[Hangzhou]

27:11.750 --> 27:12.330
Master,

27:13.070 --> 27:14.490
things are going smoothly at the dog kennel.

27:15.310 --> 27:17.380
We've trained over 30 dogs now.

27:18.240 --> 27:18.940
They can scout sentry posts and find routes,

27:19.400 --> 27:20.220
patrol borders and guard supplies,

27:20.640 --> 27:21.330
and even carry messages.

27:22.350 --> 27:23.180
A few of the dogs

27:23.640 --> 27:24.530
went with Second Master's men

27:24.550 --> 27:25.180
to Guizhou.

27:26.510 --> 27:27.570
They helped them slip past several checkpoints

27:27.960 --> 27:28.940
and transport

27:29.030 --> 27:29.900
a good deal of supplies.

27:31.830 --> 27:32.810
Keep looking for dogs.

27:33.510 --> 27:34.140
The more, the better.

27:35.030 --> 27:36.250
Bring back every dog we can train.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.730
We need to train at least 100,

27:38.920 --> 27:39.490
even 1,000.

27:40.510 --> 27:42.250
Only by spreading them far and wide

27:42.830 --> 27:43.730
can they truly make a difference

27:44.720 --> 27:46.420
to the war effort.

27:49.780 --> 28:01.340
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

28:03.860 --> 28:06.440
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

28:06.440 --> 28:07.260
"Western Heaven

28:08.960 --> 28:10.010
Within Reach."

28:10.870 --> 28:11.490
Master,

28:12.280 --> 28:13.380
what does that mean?

28:13.990 --> 28:15.060
Does it mean reaching the destination?

28:20.600 --> 28:21.650
I used to think

28:22.510 --> 28:23.780
that once Sun Wukong and his companions

28:23.800 --> 28:24.780
reached the Western Heaven,

28:25.760 --> 28:27.300
they would obtain the True Scriptures.

28:28.550 --> 28:29.420
But now I understand.

28:30.230 --> 28:31.300
Just reaching the destination

28:32.040 --> 28:33.020
doesn't mean the journey is complete.

28:34.360 --> 28:36.100
If your heart is still trapped in its old shell,

28:37.590 --> 28:38.620
even with the Western Heaven

28:38.640 --> 28:39.700
right before your eyes,

28:41.150 --> 28:41.980
it can still feel

28:43.000 --> 28:44.490
thousands of mountains and rivers away.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.770
What does that mean, Master?

28:52.400 --> 28:54.380
It means you should trust me.

28:55.960 --> 28:56.730
I'll lead you

28:58.000 --> 28:59.220
to the True Scriptures.

29:00.940 --> 29:05.180
[Battlefront]

29:28.310 --> 29:28.850
Reporting!

29:30.350 --> 29:31.290
The Japanese vanguard

29:31.480 --> 29:32.540
has broken through the Xiling defenses.

29:32.840 --> 29:33.820
Our southern position has fallen.

29:34.150 --> 29:34.820
Our forces

29:35.160 --> 29:35.900
number fewer than 3,000.

29:36.520 --> 29:37.770
The enemy outnumbers us more than three to one.

29:38.110 --> 29:39.420
Order all combat units

29:39.830 --> 29:40.940
into battle.

29:41.310 --> 29:42.250
Issue all available ammunition.

29:43.000 --> 29:43.700
Hold the line

29:44.000 --> 29:45.220
and fight to the last man!

29:45.440 --> 29:45.810
Yes, sir!

29:49.110 --> 29:50.220
Reporting, Master Zhang.

29:50.790 --> 29:51.460
Our forward scouts

29:51.550 --> 29:52.770
found an unidentified man.

29:53.160 --> 29:55.140
He claims to be an old acquaintance of yours.

29:56.830 --> 29:57.490
What's his name?

29:57.830 --> 29:58.460
He refused to give one.

29:58.880 --> 29:59.700
He only asked me to tell you

30:00.100 --> 30:02.320
he could help raise the stakes once more.

30:27.590 --> 30:28.090
Master Zhang.

30:33.750 --> 30:34.660
Comrade Zhang Qishan.

30:42.830 --> 30:43.380
Don't worry.

30:44.000 --> 30:45.180
I've arranged two teams.

30:45.880 --> 30:48.330
One is lying in wait on the southern slope of Shiling.

30:48.680 --> 30:49.290
The other

30:49.590 --> 30:51.620
has infiltrated their supply line.

30:53.310 --> 30:54.290
If your men can keep

30:54.480 --> 30:55.570
the enemy's right flank in check,

30:55.960 --> 30:56.980
we can launch

30:57.000 --> 30:57.700
a counterattack.

30:58.550 --> 30:59.460
With a well-timed

30:59.920 --> 31:01.220
pincer movement,

31:01.480 --> 31:01.980
3,000 men

31:02.750 --> 31:03.490
may still be able to tear open

31:03.550 --> 31:04.330
a gap in their lines.

31:04.750 --> 31:05.460
Exactly.

31:06.510 --> 31:07.380
We may be outnumbered,

31:07.750 --> 31:09.420
but if we strike precisely and cleverly,

31:09.750 --> 31:11.180
we still have a chance to win.

31:33.940 --> 31:38.340
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back♪

31:38.660 --> 31:43.500
♪Every moment with you appears in my heart♪

31:43.820 --> 31:48.580
♪My burning heart turns ashen, my hair turns white♪

31:48.820 --> 31:53.780
♪I look at you whilst I yearn for you♪

31:53.900 --> 31:58.420
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

31:58.620 --> 32:03.420
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

32:04.340 --> 32:08.860
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

32:08.860 --> 32:13.820
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

32:13.940 --> 32:18.340
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back...♪

32:18.340 --> 32:22.900
[Western Heaven Within Reach]

32:24.920 --> 32:26.330
Grandfather's notes say

32:27.270 --> 32:28.140
that in the end,

32:28.200 --> 32:29.660
they all found their own paths.

32:30.640 --> 32:32.380
But did they really reach their Western Heaven

32:32.920 --> 32:34.010
and obtain the True Scriptures?

32:36.440 --> 32:37.330
Grandfather said

32:38.240 --> 32:39.140
he didn't know either.

32:43.860 --> 32:48.420
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

32:48.860 --> 32:55.700
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

32:58.220 --> 33:03.020
[Wu Xie, Wu Laogou's grandson]

33:05.110 --> 33:06.050
Is the owner here?

33:06.310 --> 33:07.730
Do you buy rubbings?

33:08.640 --> 33:09.290
Yes.

33:13.300 --> 33:17.420
[The End]

33:34.980 --> 33:39.140
♪The past fades like smoke♪

33:39.500 --> 33:42.220
♪A choice is made in silence♪

33:42.500 --> 33:45.300
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

33:45.700 --> 33:49.460
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

33:49.700 --> 33:53.140
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

33:53.420 --> 33:56.820
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

33:56.900 --> 34:04.180
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

34:04.620 --> 34:07.900
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

34:08.180 --> 34:11.420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

34:11.580 --> 34:15.620
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

34:15.820 --> 34:19.180
♪Who believes in fate?♪

34:19.420 --> 34:22.780
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

34:23.020 --> 34:26.300
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

34:26.620 --> 34:30.300
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

34:30.500 --> 34:33.740
♪Take care♪

34:33.740 --> 34:36.300
♪We once raced♪

34:36.380 --> 34:38.300
♪For the dawn♪

34:38.460 --> 34:41.740
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

34:41.860 --> 34:45.140
♪In the web of fate♪

34:45.140 --> 34:48.340
♪No one can escape♪

34:49.340 --> 34:51.180
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

34:51.340 --> 34:52.900
♪We too were young once♪

34:52.980 --> 34:56.420
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

34:56.620 --> 34:58.940
♪Keep the ember lit♪

34:59.060 --> 35:03.580
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

35:03.700 --> 35:06.660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

35:06.900 --> 35:10.420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

35:10.540 --> 35:14.300
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

35:14.620 --> 35:18.100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

35:18.260 --> 35:21.260
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

35:21.500 --> 35:25.260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

35:25.420 --> 35:29.140
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

35:29.260 --> 35:40.700
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
